ISO-10303-21;
/* Tsh153: TWO OPEN_SHELLs nested three SHELL_BASED_SURFACE_MODEL wrappers deep — IS the deeply-nested-compound recursion mechanism; Shell1 (Face0 x=[0,1] + Face1 x=[1,2]) IS wired into OPEN_SHELL at depth-0; Shell2 (Face2 x=[2,3] + Face3 x=[3,4]) IS wired into OPEN_SHELL at depth-0; both SBSMs ARE referenced via nested PRODUCT representation chain; outer SBSM IS the depth-3 compound wrapper — IS the recursion-depth mechanism; ShapeAnalysis_Shell.LoadShells recurses into compounds to find shells; recursion truncation at depth < 3 drops innermost shell; fix: increase recursion depth or use iterative compound traversal; emit E_LOAD_SHELLS_RECURSION_TRUNCATED when inner shells not reached */
